    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[GAME INTRODUCTION]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the riddles and escape from the room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game comes with auto-save, so you can play from the beginning of the game at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have trouble solving the riddle, you can see the hints and solutions in the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[How to play]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the place you are interested in to investigate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select an item by clicking on it, and click on the location where you want to use it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the item to enlarge it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items will combine with each other if you use another item on the enlarged item. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Room Collection</strong> is a game in which you use the mouse to click on various places in the room, solve puzzles, and escape from the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 21 tiny rooms in total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape from all the rooms? </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[GAME INTRODUCTION]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the riddles and escape from the room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game comes with auto-save, so you can play from the beginning of the game at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have trouble solving the riddle, you can see the hints and solutions in the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[How to play]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the place you are interested in to investigate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select an item by clicking on it, and click on the location where you want to use it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the item to enlarge it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items will combine with each other if you use another item on the enlarged item. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Room Collection</strong> is a game in which you use the mouse to click on various places in the room, solve puzzles, and escape from the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 21 tiny rooms in total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape from all the rooms? </p>",
